00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.290
Your CEO is often
your top advocate

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:12.210
to help bring the adoption
of AI and ML in the business.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:16.390
Third is thinking about
how you can test for scale.

